<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-AO">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>SIP — Acesso Restrito</title>
  <%= csrf_meta_tags %>
  <style>
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@600;700&display=swap');
    :root { --primary: #1e3a5f; --primary-light: #2c4f7c; --primary-dark: #0f1f33; --accent: #c9a227; --bg: #f8fafc; --surface: #ffffff; --text: #0f172a; --text-muted: #64748b; --border: #e2e8f0; }
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); min-height: 100vh; }
    .container { min-height: 100vh; display: flex; }
    .brand-panel { flex: 1; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-dark) 0%, var(--primary) 50%, var(--primary-light) 100%); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 3rem; position: relative; }
    .brand-panel::after { content: ''; position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 4px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent) 0%, var(--accent-light) 50%, var(--accent) 100%); }
    .brand-content { text-align: center; max-width: 400px; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
    .coat-of-arms { width: 100px; height: 100px; margin: 0 auto 2rem; }
    .coat-of-arms__shield { width: 100%; height: 100%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 25%, 100% 75%, 50% 100%, 0% 75%, 0% 25%); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border: 2px solid var(--accent); }
    .coat-of-arms__icon { width: 50px; height: 50px; color: var(--accent); }
    .brand-title { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: white; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .brand-subtitle { font-size: 0.75rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.15em; }
    .form-panel { width: 480px; min-width: 480px; background: var(--surface); display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
    .form-header { padding: 2.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .form-header__back { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.875rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .form-header__back:hover { color: var(--primary); }
    .form-header__title { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
    .form-header__desc { font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
    .form-body { flex: 1; padding: 2.5rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem; }
    .alert-box { padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 0.625rem; background: #fef3c7; border: 1px solid #fcd34d; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.75rem; }
    .alert-box svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; color: #92400e; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .alert-box__content { font-size: 0.875rem; color: #92400e; line-height: 1.6; }
    .alert-box strong { font-weight: 600; }
    .contact-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
    .contact-card { padding: 1rem; border-radius: 0.625rem; border: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--bg); }
    .contact-card__icon { width: 32px; height: 32px; background: var(--primary); border-radius: 0.5rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
    .contact-card__icon svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; color: white; }
    .contact-card__title { font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
    .contact-card__info { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.5; }
    .return-btn { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.875rem; border: 1.5px solid var(--border); border-radius: 0.625rem; color: var(--text); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.9375rem; transition: all 0.2s; margin-top: 1rem; }
    .return-btn:hover { border-color: var(--primary); color: var(--primary); background: #f8fafc; }
    .bottom-bar { background: var(--primary-dark); padding: 1rem 1.5rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; font-size: 0.75rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); }
    .bottom-bar a { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); text-decoration: none; }
    .bottom-bar a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
    @media (max-width: 1023px) { .brand-panel { display: none; } .form-panel { width: 100%; min-width: unset; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="brand-panel">
      <div class="brand-content">
        <div class="coat-of-arms">
          <div class="coat-of-arms__shield">
            <svg class="coat-of-arms__icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h1 class="brand-title">Sistema de<br>Instrução Processual</h1>
        <p class="brand-subtitle">Acesso Restrito</p>
        <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.7;margin-top:1.5rem;">
          O Sistema de Instrução Processual é exclusivo para pessoal autorizado do Serviço de Investigação Criminal.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="form-panel">
      <div class="form-header">
        <a href="<%= new_account_session_path(resource_name) %>" class="form-header__back">
          <svg width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18"/>
          </svg>
          Voltar ao login
        </a>
        <h2 class="form-header__title">Acesso Restrito</h2>
        <p class="form-header__desc">Este sistema é privado e exclusivo para pessoal autorizado</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="form-body">
        <div class="alert-box">
          <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"/>
          </svg>
          <div class="alert-box__content">
            <strong>Aviso de Acesso Restrito</strong><br>
            O sistema SIP é exclusivo para membros autorizados da SIC. O registo de novas contas deve ser solicitado através dos canais oficiais.
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div>
          <h3 style="font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:0.5rem;color:var(--text);">Canais para solicitação de acesso:</h3>
          <div class="contact-grid">
            <div class="contact-card">
              <div class="contact-card__icon">
                <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="contact-card__title">Email</div>
              <div class="contact-card__info">ti@sic.gov.ao</div>
            </div>
            <div class="contact-card">
              <div class="contact-card__icon">
                <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="contact-card__title">Telefone</div>
              <div class="contact-card__info">+244 222 123 456</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <a href="<%= new_account_session_path(resource_name) %>" class="return-btn">
          <svg width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18"/>
          </svg>
          Voltar à página de login
        </a>
      </div>
      
      <div style="padding:1.5rem 2.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--bg);">
        <p style="font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--text-muted);text-align:center;">
          Sistema certificado ISO 27001 — Tentativas de acesso não autorizado serão registadas e reportadas.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  
  <div class="bottom-bar">
    <div>
      <span>SIP v2.0 — República de Angola</span>
      <span style="margin:0 0.5rem;">|</span>
      <span>© <%= Date.current.year %> SIC Angola</span>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:1rem;">
      <a href="#">Política de Privacidade</a>
      <a href="#">Termos de Uso</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
